# Chips (bastok 82): Ghebi Damomohe in Lower Jeuno, Cid in the Metalworks. The guard (the quest's mustZone clear, and CoP
# One to be Feared completed, or current with Mission[6][638]Status at 1 or more), the offer 169 (option 0 begins it,
# option 1 sets the mustZone, another option does nothing), a Carmine, a Cyan and a Gray Chip at Cid (883: completed, CCB
# Polymer, San d'Oria and Bastok fame +5 each); with no free slot or a CCB Polymer held, ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED instead
# (the handler returns messageSpecial's nil). Once completed the same trade plays 884 (#completed).
# Ghebi Damomohe has his own script (the Astral Covenant ENM, Tenshodo Membership; nothing for this char) and is CoP 3-5's.
# Cid's default 500; his other quests and missions need what this char lacks (Dark Puppet: DRK 50; Shoot First: its own
# guard; CoP 3-1 onward at Cid: this char is on 6-4, check the trace for a CoP 6-4 action at Cid). CoP missions are set
# current, never `completed` (that writes no flag for CoP); "completed" is the next mission current (#cop_done). The
# mission is set before login: after login addMission warns that it overwrites the fresh char's CoP mission (a script
# error to the recorder), so the side with no CoP 6-4 is #no_cop.
lists LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/169 Metalworks/Cid/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/883
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=15.5,-0.1,-6.1
mission Cop OneToBeFeared current
item CarmineChip
item CyanChip
item GrayChip
login
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe               # 6-4 current, Status 0: nil, his script
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[6][638]Status 1
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe               # 6-4 current, Status 1: 169
finish option=1                      # the mustZone set
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe               # the mustZone: nil, his script
finish-if-event
zoneline PortJeuno                   # another zone: the mustZone cleared
zoneline LowerJeuno
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe               # 169
finish option=2                      # neither 0 nor 1: nothing
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe               # 169
finish                               # option 0: accepted
warp -12.6,-11,4 Metalworks
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 # two chips: nil
fill-inventory
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (nil)
free-inventory
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # 883
fill-inventory
finish                               # the inventory filled while 883 is open: the polymer not given, not completed
free-inventory
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # 883 again
finish                               # completed: CCB Polymer, San d'Oria +5, Bastok +5, the chips taken
